WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.424
With gettext, the tools extract,

2
00:00:03.424 --> 00:00:06.662
merge, and compile, and
people finish every entry.

3
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.298
The gettext tools do this well,

4
00:00:09.298 --> 00:00:11.585
with plural rules, context,

5
00:00:11.585 --> 00:00:12.780
and safe merges.

6
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.877
General Translation generates
and maintains the PO files,

7
00:00:16.877 --> 00:00:18.815
and gettext keeps the rest.

8
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:22.994
Point the gt config
at your POT template,

9
00:00:22.994 --> 00:00:24.828
with a transform for each language.

10
00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:31.397
Then npx gt translate runs between
xgettext and msgfmt in your

11
00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:31.872
build.

12
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.030
It keeps translator
notes and context,

13
00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:37.084
and reviewers edit in the Dashboard.

14
00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.470
Your team now ships
German with each release.
